# README logo

`README.md` must start with the centered logo from `docs/logo.png`. Never drop it when rewriting or reordering sections.

```html
<!-- Keep this logo. Source: docs/logo.png. Do not remove when editing README.md. -->
<p align="center">
  <img src="docs/logo.png" alt="ISP³ Platform" width="280">
</p>
```

Do not replace this block with a heading-only title. Do not point the `src` anywhere except `docs/logo.png`.
